-- a voluntary organisation living with a parent of the child: Is the enhanced rate withheld from this child by regulation 2(4)
-- reg 2(4): either limb is enough ("or").
#ASSERT (`Is the enhanced rate withheld from this child by regulation 2(4)` WITH `I am a voluntary organisation` IS TRUE, `I live with a parent of the child` IS TRUE, `I live with that parent as mentioned in regulation 2(2)(a)` IS FALSE)

