-- Mary, with the pension increase for the child: Does my payment give me the enhanced rate for this child
-- reg 2(5)(a) and (b), the benefit being specified under reg 2(6)(a).
#ASSERT (`Does my payment give me the enhanced rate for this child` WITH `this is the only or the eldest child I am paid child benefit for` IS TRUE, `the kind of payment I am paid for the week` IS `a benefit under SSCBA`, `receiving it entitles me to an increase for dependants listed in Schedule 4` IS TRUE, `the instrument the allowance is granted under` IS `an instrument not listed in paragraph (6)(c)(i) to (vii)`, `the Commissioners accept it as analogous to a listed allowance` IS FALSE, `the payment is paid to me for the week` IS TRUE, `the payment is paid for this child` IS TRUE)

