-- someone paid a payment of some other kind: Does my payment give me the enhanced rate for this child
-- reg 2(6): not a specified benefit.
#ASSERT NOT (`Does my payment give me the enhanced rate for this child` WITH `this is the only or the eldest child I am paid child benefit for` IS TRUE, `the kind of payment I am paid for the week` IS `a payment of some other kind`, `receiving it entitles me to an increase for dependants listed in Schedule 4` IS FALSE, `the instrument the allowance is granted under` IS `an instrument not listed in paragraph (6)(c)(i) to (vii)`, `the Commissioners accept it as analogous to a listed allowance` IS FALSE, `the payment is paid to me for the week` IS TRUE, `the payment is paid for this child` IS TRUE)

-- a benefit under SSCBA with a Schedule 4 increase: Is my payment a specified benefit
-- reg 2(6)(a).
#ASSERT (`Is my payment a specified benefit` WITH `the kind of payment I am paid for the week` IS `a benefit under SSCBA`, `receiving it entitles me to an increase for dependants listed in Schedule 4` IS TRUE, `the instrument the allowance is granted under` IS `an instrument not listed in paragraph (6)(c)(i) to (vii)`, `the Commissioners accept it as analogous to a listed allowance` IS FALSE)

-- a benefit under SSCBA with no such increase: Is my payment a specified benefit
-- reg 2(6)(a): receipt must entitle to an increase specified in the Table.
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my payment a specified benefit` WITH `the kind of payment I am paid for the week` IS `a benefit under SSCBA`, `receiving it entitles me to an increase for dependants listed in Schedule 4` IS FALSE, `the instrument the allowance is granted under` IS `an instrument not listed in paragraph (6)(c)(i) to (vii)`, `the Commissioners accept it as analogous to a listed allowance` IS FALSE)

-- a benefit under SSCB(NI)A with a Schedule 4 increase: Is my payment a specified benefit
-- reg 2(6)(b).
#ASSERT (`Is my payment a specified benefit` WITH `the kind of payment I am paid for the week` IS `a benefit under SSCB(NI)A`, `receiving it entitles me to an increase for dependants listed in Schedule 4` IS TRUE, `the instrument the allowance is granted under` IS `an instrument not listed in paragraph (6)(c)(i) to (vii)`, `the Commissioners accept it as analogous to a listed allowance` IS FALSE)

-- an allowance under the Pensions (Polish Forces) Scheme 1964: Is my payment a specified benefit
-- reg 2(6)(c)(iii).
#ASSERT (`Is my payment a specified benefit` WITH `the kind of payment I am paid for the week` IS `an allowance for a child or a qualifying young person granted in respect of the death of a person due to service or war injury`, `receiving it entitles me to an increase for dependants listed in Schedule 4` IS FALSE, `the instrument the allowance is granted under` IS `the Pensions (Polish Forces) Scheme 1964`, `the Commissioners accept it as analogous to a listed allowance` IS FALSE)

-- a death-in-service allowance under an unlisted instrument that the Commissioners accept as analogous: Is my payment a specified benefit
