#ASSERT (`What weekly amount of child benefit is payable for this child` WITH `the first day of the week` IS (Date 1 6 2026), `child benefit is payable to me for this child` IS TRUE, `the child's date of birth` IS (Date 15 3 2015), `the person I claim for is a child` IS TRUE, `where the young person is` IS `in Great Britain`, `the young person is a qualifying young person under Part 9` IS FALSE, `this is the only or the eldest child I am paid child benefit for` IS TRUE, `I live with a parent of the child` IS FALSE, `I live with that parent as mentioned in regulation 2(2)(a)` IS FALSE, `I am a voluntary organisation` IS FALSE, `I live with my spouse or civil partner` IS FALSE, `I live with another person as my spouse or civil partner` IS FALSE, `a party to my marriage is married to more than one person` IS FALSE, `my marriage ceremony took place under the law of a country which permits polygamy` IS FALSE, `I live with the other members of my marriage` IS FALSE, `child benefit would be payable at the enhanced rate to someone else in my household` IS FALSE, `the date of birth of the eldest of the children they would be paid the enhanced rate for` IS (Date 1 1 2000), `the kind of payment I am paid for the week` IS `a payment of some other kind`, `receiving it entitles me to an increase for dependants listed in Schedule 4` IS FALSE, `the instrument the allowance is granted under` IS `an instrument not listed in paragraph (6)(c)(i) to (vii)`, `the Commissioners accept it as analogous to a listed allowance` IS FALSE, `the payment is paid to me for the week` IS FALSE, `the payment is paid for this child` IS FALSE, `the earlier rates with the 1998 savings would have given me an amount` IS TRUE, `the weekly amount the earlier rates would have given me` IS 27.04) EQUALS JUST 27.05

