-- child benefit under SSCBA: Which transitional provisions and savings apply to me
-- reg 3(2)(a).
#ASSERT (`Which transitional provisions and savings apply to me` WITH `the Act under which my child benefit is payable` IS `child benefit payable under SSCBA`) EQUALS `regulations 3 and 4 of the Child Benefit and Social Security (Fixing and Adjustment of Rates) (Amendment) Regulations 1998`

-- child benefit under SSCB(NI)A: Which transitional provisions and savings apply to me
-- reg 3(2)(b).
#ASSERT (`Which transitional provisions and savings apply to me` WITH `the Act under which my child benefit is payable` IS `child benefit payable under SSCB(NI)A`) EQUALS `regulations 3 and 4 of the Child Benefit and Social Security (Fixing and Adjustment of Rates) (Amendment) Regulations (Northern Ireland) 1998`

-- the prescribed £27.05, earlier rates £30.00: What is the greater amount payable under the saving
-- reg 3(1).
